/// Synopsis: the documented limits of the animations in the shorthand boxes, each next to its way out: a `#pause` between the lines of a `>` box shows the box whole on the first step (its bottom edge lightly veiled) and holds back only what follows it; quotations on consecutive lines show on the first step as plain text in quotation marks, while quotations separated by blank lines are revealed one per step. The other documented limits are in the other `sections/pause-limits-*` tests; "Unsupported mark" in `tests/errors/`; the covered content that runs on to the next page in `sections/pause-overflow`.
